flowchart TD
    Wake["task becomes runnable<br/><b>does:</b> wakeup/fork/preemption makes task eligible<br/><b>why next:</b> sched_ext must choose a queue and slice<br/><b>state:</b> task has runnable state and previous CPU"]
    Enq["ops.enqueue(task, flags)<br/><b>does:</b> BPF chooses DSQ, slice, FIFO vs vtime ordering<br/><b>why next:</b> task must wait somewhere until a CPU asks<br/><b>state:</b> scx_bpf_dsq_insert* records queue ownership"]
    DSQ["Dispatch Queue (DSQ)<br/><b>does:</b> kernel-managed runnable-task queue<br/><b>why next:</b> CPU-local dispatch pulls from DSQ when it needs work<br/><b>state:</b> task ordered by policy"]
    Idle["CPU needs a task<br/><b>does:</b> current task blocked, yielded, or exhausted slice<br/><b>why next:</b> ops.dispatch can move work local<br/><b>state:</b> CPU local DSQ needs refill"]
    Dispatch["ops.dispatch(cpu, prev)<br/><b>does:</b> BPF calls scx_bpf_dsq_move_to_local or inserts local work<br/><b>why next:</b> core scheduler can only run tasks from local DSQ<br/><b>state:</b> task moved to CPU-local runnable slot"]
    Run["CPU runs task<br/><b>does:</b> consumes slice until block/preempt/exit<br/><b>why next:</b> task may wake/enqueue again or leave scheduler<br/><b>state:</b> runtime accounted; watchdog sees progress"]

    Wake --> Enq --> DSQ
    Idle --> Dispatch --> Run
    DSQ --> Dispatch
    Run -->|blocks then wakes| Wake
    Run -->|slice ends| Wake

    classDef bpf fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706
    classDef state fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a
    class Enq,Dispatch bpf
    class Wake,DSQ,Idle,Run state
